## Limits

From [wrangler.toml](mdc:wrangler.toml):
```toml
[limits]
cpu_ms = 50  # 50ms CPU time limit per request
```

## Cost Guards

See [src/guards/costCap.ts](mdc:src/guards/costCap.ts) for:
- Hard cost limits
- Graceful degradation
- Request quotas

## Rate Limiting

See [src/guards/rateLimit.ts](mdc:src/guards/rateLimit.ts):
- 10 req/s per IP (in-memory, per-instance)
- ⚠️ Not shared across instances
- Consider Durable Objects for distributed rate limiting

## Deployment

```bash
# Deploy to default
wrangler deploy

# Deploy to production
wrangler deploy --env production

# Apply migrations first
wrangler d1 migrations apply betting-analytics --remote
```

